# shell: desktop
# home: fixture
# The alert layer's classic-HIG looks: a bold one-line summary over plain
# detail (Mac ch3), buttons sized uniformly by the longest label, the STOP
# severity wearing its own red, and a default ring only while the window
# owns the keyboard (NeXT ch7).
wait 10
click-row 1
wait 2
key Delete
wait 5
note the summary line is BOLD: the doubled stem of its first letter
expect-pixel 537 190 000000
expect-pixel 550 190 000000
note the buttons are label-sized: Cancel starts where Move to Trash needs
note (its hairline, at mid height, clear of the rounded corners)
expect-pixel 370 296 828282
key Escape
wait 3
note a refusal is a STOP and wears the red disc, not the caution yellow
key w ctrl
wait 3
click-desk Boot
wait 3
key Delete
wait 6
expect-pixel 308 212 cb3030
key Return
wait 3
note the Find window's Search button wears the accent only while Return
note would hit it -- the default button is the filled one now
key f ctrl
wait 5
expect-pixel 690 391 336698
note focus elsewhere: the fill must not promise a Return it will not get
click-desk photos
wait 1
click-desk photos
wait 6
expect-pixel 690 391 d8d8d8
quit
